## Introduction

Welcome to the journal for the **ALL-BOT**. 

This journal serves as a complete development log tracking the hardware design, CAD modeling, mechanical problem-solving, and PCB layout[cite: 1, 86]. The objective is to build a reliable, modular tracked robot capable of performing versatile tasks and carrying heavy payloads like robotic arms or solar panels[cite: 1, 85, 86]. 

